              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which piece of হ্যাঁ (hyã) makes no sound? (য.) And which word took nine lessons to become readable? (নমস্কার.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
