              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Which piece of the verb carries \"I\"? (The ি ending.) So is আমি (āmi) required? (No — it is emphasis.)"
